abstract: >-
  Source code, synthetic order-processing traces and analysis for the CACDP Study 2
  benchmark. The package contains the Kafka and HTTP testbed, the recorded data from
  45 runs, and scripts to reconstruct the feature windows and model evaluations.
  Study 1 includes the published run-level latency summaries; the replay checks the
  queue model against those values.
